<view class="wrap">
  <view style="padding:12rpx 8rpx 28rpx">
    <view class="h1">去预约</view>
    <view class="sub">先选门店，再挑日期和时段</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card"><view class="empty">加载中…</view></view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:for="{{clinics}}" wx:key="clinic_id"
          class="opt {{item.clinic_id === cid ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-id="{{item.clinic_id}}" bindtap="pick">
      <view>
        <view class="t">{{item.clinic_name}}</view>
        <view class="s">{{item.postal_address || '地址待补'}}</view>
        <view class="s">{{item.phone || ''}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tag blue">选这家</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card" style="margin-top:24rpx">
      <view class="card-title">怎么约</view>
      <view class="muted">
        点上面任意一家门店，会列出这家店未来两周的号。
        选日期 → 选时段 → 核对一下提交，提交后这个号就占住了。
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
